# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A Soroban multisig wallet contract scaffolded by [Sorobix](https://github.com/Soro-Bix/soroban-scaffold).

## Template: Multisig (threshold confirmations)

- `initialize(signers, threshold)`
- `submit(to, amount, data)` — records a proposal, returns its id
- `confirm(id)` — a signer approves; returns `true` once the threshold is reached
- `is_confirmed(id)` / `threshold()`

## Build

```bash
cargo build --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --release
cargo test
```
